  "domain": "tier0/api-probes/resource-retrieve-cached-url",
  "description": "API probe (task phase3.1_assets3d-cutover; decision 112): Resource.retrieve as the Assets3D layer-stack sync uses it to decide whether a mask resource cached by an earlier sync is still in the project. On the plane, mask_left_half imported as TEXTURE and bound as the source of a mask fill (insert_fill, add_mask Black, insert_fill inside the Mask stack, set_source(None, resource)), as the sync binds its masks; then, as probes in each recording: ResourceID.from_url of the import's URL (in the first session the URL of the current project; after save and reopen the URL cached in the context the resource was imported in) and Resource.retrieve of it; ResourceID.from_project of the import's name and version and Resource.retrieve of it; ResourceID.from_project of an authored name the project does not hold with an authored version, and of the import's name with an authored version it does not hold, each with Resource.retrieve; and the mask fill's source. Each retrieve records the identifiers of the resources it returned, in order; in the first session and after save and reopen.",
  "inputs": [
    {
      "input_id": "plane",
      "kind": "mesh",
      "path": "parity/fixtures/meshes/plane.obj",
      "sha256": "7d3c5f616c2abf4b06050434fa943d19dcb15ec998245a211d1d4ca7e95197fe",
      "provenance": {
